    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84465" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πολιεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>guardian of the city,</i> of Zeus, <i><span class="en">
